    "operation": "Build num_lists linked lists of initial_length zero-count nodes. For each iteration, traverse lists in order, accumulate each current count and increment it; add 0.333 to the fractional growth state and append the whole-part number of nodes per list at each tail, assigning source counts list_index+ordinal.",
